---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import portrait from '../assets/portrait.jpg';
import fireTruck from '../assets/fire-truck.jpg';

const goals = ['Get a motorcycle', 'Travel to Ethiopia', 'Collect art', 'Learn a backflip'];
const habits = ['Gym', 'Guitar', 'Gaming', 'YouTube', 'Deep in a playlist'];
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="Wayne Simmons: senior CS major at Queens College, Accenture AI/ML Fellow with Break Through Tech AI, and future ML engineer from Brooklyn."
>
  <article class="wrap about">
    <header class="about__head">
      <div>
        <p class="label"><b>[02]</b> About</p>
        <h1 class="about__title">Hi, I'm Wayne.</h1>
        <p class="about__lede">
          I'm a senior Computer Science major at Queens College (CUNY), graduating in May 2027. I build AI to get things
          done, and I'm building toward a career in ML engineering.
        </p>
      </div>
      <figure class="about__portrait">
        <Image src={portrait} alt="Portrait of Wayne Simmons in glasses and a black quarter-zip" width={640} widths={[320, 480, 640]} sizes="(max-width: 800px) 60vw, 320px" loading="eager" />
      </figure>
    </header>

    <div class="about__body prose">
      <h2><span class="label"><b>[a]</b></span> Where I'm from</h2>
      <p>
        I was born in Brooklyn, and my family's roots are Trinidadian and Guyanese. New York is home base, and these
        days that means Queens.
      </p>

      <h2><span class="label"><b>[b]</b></span> How I got here</h2>
      <p>
        I'm drawn to the part of AI where research meets reality, where models stop being experiments and start solving
        actual problems. Right now that means being an Accenture AI/ML Fellow with Break Through Tech AI, a 12-month
        applied ML program I was selected for out of 4,300+ applicants. After ML foundations, I'm on a 7-person team
        building <a href="/work/cuad-contract-triage/">contract clause detection and risk triage</a> for Accenture.
      </p>
      <p>
        The rest of my week keeps me sharp in ways a CS curriculum doesn't always cover. I've been an Apple Retail
        Specialist since 2022, matching people with the right tech and explaining it at their level. I'm a Resident
        Assistant at The Summit, a 400+ student community at Queens College, and president of our Cru campus chapter.
        Between them: communication, accountability, and being the person people come to when things go sideways.
      </p>

      <h2><span class="label"><b>[c]</b></span> The long game</h2>
      <p>
        ML engineering is the job. The through-line is building AI that gets real things done for people, whether that's
        telling a legal team which contracts to read first or keeping YouTube from swallowing an afternoon. The biggest
        version of it is child protection and anti-trafficking work: systems that answer faster and anticipate sooner,
        so people get help before they have to ask.
      </p>
    </div>

    <section class="clock-off" aria-labelledby="off-title">
      <div class="clock-off__text">
        <p class="label"><b>[d]</b> Off the clock</p>
        <h2 id="off-title" class="clock-off__title">Not everything is a model.</h2>
        <ul class="habits mono">
          {habits.map((h) => <li>{h}</li>)}
        </ul>
        <p class="label goals__label">Goals, unranked</p>
        <ul class="goals">
          {
            goals.map((g) => (
              <li>
                <span class="mono" aria-hidden="true">[ ]</span> {g}
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
      </div>
      <figure class="clock-off__photo">
        <Image src={fireTruck} alt="Wayne standing in front of an FDNY fire truck on a city street" width={960} widths={[480, 720, 960]} sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 480px" />
      </figure>
    </section>

    <p class="about__cta">
      Working on something interesting? <a href="/contact/">[04] Get in touch</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .about {
    padding-block: clamp(48px, 8vw, 96px);
  }
  .about__head {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr minmax(200px, 320px);
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: end;
  }
  .about__title {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: clamp(48px, 9vw, 120px);
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
  }
  .about__lede {
    max-width: 44ch;
    margin-top: 24px;
    font-size: clamp(19px, 2.2vw, 24px);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  figure {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .about__portrait img,
  .clock-off__photo img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .about__portrait img {
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
  }
  .about__body {
    margin-top: 72px;
  }
  .about__body h2 {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .clock-off {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr minmax(240px, 420px);
    gap: 48px;
    margin-top: 96px;
    padding-top: 48px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .clock-off__title {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 48px);
  }
  .habits {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 28px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .habits li {
    padding: 6px 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .goals__label {
    margin-top: 32px;
  }
  .goals {
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    font-size: 20px;
  }
  .goals li {
    padding: 10px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--border);
  }
  .goals .mono {
    color: var(--accent-text);
    margin-right: 8px;
  }
  .clock-off__photo img {
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
  }
  .about__cta {
    margin-top: 80px;
    font-size: 20px;
  }
  .about__cta a {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--accent-text);
  }
  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .about__head,
    .clock-off {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .about__portrait {
      max-width: 260px;
      grid-row: 1;
    }
  }
</style>
